  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Summary:<br><br>Grande Pointe Princess<br><br><br><br>The Space:<br><br>This 3BR/3BA coastal cottage is situated in Grande Pointe at Inlet Beach -- a half-mile stroll or drive to the white sand beaches of 30A -- making it a great getaway for families and friends. Relax at the pool and clubhouse overlooking scenic Lake Powell. Fish, hike, or kayak at neighboring Camp Helen State Park. Rosemary Beach is just 1.5 miles away from Grande Pointe. Whether you want to explore the nearby amenities or just find a quiet spot to relax, this three-story home has something for everyone. The light-filled second-floor main living area has two sofas (one is a sleeper sofa), accent chairs, and a 55” flat-screen TV -- ideal for a movie night. On the ground floor, the second living area has a sofa, two armchairs, a desk area, and a flat-screen TV. Prepare meals in the gourmet kitchen complete with stainless steel appliances. Perch at the island bar with seating for three, where you can sip morning brew made from your choice of a Keurig or full-size coffee maker. When dinner is ready, gather at the expandable dining table with seating for eight.<br><br><br><br>This three-story home sleeps up to eight guests in three bedrooms and a sleeper sofa. The third floor is dedicated to the master suite, which has a king bed, private seating area, and 50” flat-screen TV. The luxurious en-suite bathroom has a double vanity, separate water closet, and walk-in shower with dual showerheads. On the second floor, the second bedroom has two twin beds and 42” flat-screen TV. The second bathroom has a tub/shower combination. The third bedroom is on the ground floor and has a queen bed and 32” flat-screen TV. The third bathroom has a walk-in shower.<br><br><br><br>Enter the home from the beach-themed front porch, furnished with two love seats. The ground-floor balcony area has seating for two and is ideal for morning coffee. On the second floor, a smaller balcony has two armchairs and a love seat, while the larger balcony has a grill and a table with seating for six. Additional folding chairs are provided. Guest amenities include complimentary Wi-Fi, a washer/dryer, and parking for two cars (one in the garage and one in the driveway). Parking on the grass or on the street is strictly prohibited.<br><br><br><br>Your rental is located at the eastern end of Scenic 30A near wide-open beach access and breathtaking gulf views, sweeping sand dunes, and untouched wildlife. The nearest Gulf of Mexico beach access is a convenient half-mile walk or drive away. Explore the amenities of Grande Pointe: take a dip in the pool or go for a stroll around Lake Powell, a pristine coastal dune lake. Nature lovers can hike, fish, or birdwatch at nearby Camp Helen State Park (less than a mile away). Find local restaurants and boutiques at 30Avenue next to Grande Pointe. Adjacent Rosemary Beach offers world-class restaurants, boutique shops, a weekly farmers’ market, and festivals throughout the year.<br><br><br><br>Things to Know<br><br>Owner will be replacing the downstairs queen bed with a king.<br><br>Enjoy the best that 30A has to offer, including both nearby beach and lake access.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "New Cottage Near 30A Rosemary Beach with 2 Master Suites"
        }
      ],
